    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nindentscope\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nhello,\r\n\r\nafter installing indentscope (with lazy) together with indent-blackline the animation for the indent is only shown once on the first restart, after i quit and start nvim again i see the indent from indent-blankline but not the animation from indentscope.\r\n\r\nrelevant part of lazy config:\r\n```\r\n  {\r\n    \"lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim\",\r\n    event = \"BufReadPost\",\r\n    opts = {\r\n      char = '┊',\r\n      filetype_exclude = { \"help\", \"alpha\", \"dashboard\", \"neo-tree\", \"Trouble\", \"lazy\" },\r\n      show_trailing_blankline_indent = false,\r\n      -- space_char_blankline = \" \",\r\n      show_current_context = false,\r\n      -- show_current_context_start = true,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"echasnovski/mini.indentscope\",\r\n    event = \"BufReadPre\",\r\n    opts = {\r\n      -- symbol = \"▏\",\r\n      symbol = \"┊\",\r\n      options = { try_as_border = true },\r\n    },\r\n    config = function(_, opts)\r\n      vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"FileType\", {\r\n        pattern = { \"help\", \"alpha\", \"dashboard\", \"neo-tree\", \"Trouble\", \"lazy\", \"mason\" },\r\n        callback = function()\r\n          vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = true\r\n        end,\r\n      })\r\n      require(\"mini.indentscope\").setup(opts)\r\n    end,\r\n  },\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen i deinstall indent-blankline and install it again (with restart in between) on the first start with both enabled i see the animation , but after a restart it is \"broken\" again.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Neovim version\r\n\r\nNVIM v0.9.0-dev\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. install indentscope together with indent-blankline \r\n2. restart nvim\r\n3. animation is shown\r\n4. restart nvim\r\n5. animation is not shown\r\n\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nanimation is shown \r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nanimation is not shown on second start with both indentscope and indent-blankline enabled\r\n\r\nfirst start after install\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1894476/217049796-867646df-ad0d-4c53-b310-7fb8864abee8.png)\r\n\r\nsecond start\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1894476/217049876-e345014c-344f-479d-9bbc-eafedbcda5b5.png)\r\n\r\n",
