            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "i got a table back with the 1st command:\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  auto_draw = <function 1>,\r\n  config = {\r\n    draw = {\r\n      animation = <function 2>,\r\n      delay = 100\r\n    },\r\n    mappings = {\r\n      goto_bottom = \"]i\",\r\n      goto_top = \"[i\",\r\n      object_scope = \"ii\",\r\n      object_scope_with_border = \"ai\"\r\n    },\r\n    options = {\r\n      border = \"both\",\r\n      indent_at_cursor = true,\r\n      try_as_border = true\r\n    },\r\n    symbol = \"┊\"\r\n  },\r\n  draw = <function 3>,\r\n  gen_animation = {\r\n    cubic = <function 4>,\r\n    exponential = <function 5>,\r\n    linear = <function 6>,\r\n    none = <function 7>,\r\n    quadratic = <function 8>,\r\n    quartic = <function 9>,\r\n    <metatable> = {\r\n      __call = <function 10>\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  get_scope = <function 11>,\r\n  move_cursor = <function 12>,\r\n  operator = <function 13>,\r\n  setup = <function 14>,\r\n  textobject = <function 15>,\r\n  undraw = <function 16>\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\ni get also au back\r\n\r\n```\r\n--- Autocommands ---\r\nMiniIndentscope  CursorMoved\r\n*lua MiniIndentscope.auto_draw({ lazy = true })\r\nMiniIndentscope  CursorMovedI\r\n*lua MiniIndentscope.auto_draw({ lazy = true })\r\nMiniIndentscope  ModeChanged\r\n*:*lua MiniIndentscope.auto_draw({ lazy = true })\r\nMiniIndentscope  TextChanged\r\n*lua MiniIndentscope.auto_draw()\r\nMiniIndentscope  TextChangedI\r\n*lua MiniIndentscope.auto_draw()\r\nMiniIndentscope  TextChangedP\r\n*lua MiniIndentscope.auto_draw()\r\nMiniIndentscope  WinScrolled\r\n*lua MiniIndentscope.auto_draw()\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nare there any missing?",
